				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>みつけにくい　ポケモンも　いるから
あきらめずに　草むらを　歩いてね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：イッシュ図鑑
・みた数が
　25～39匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
