				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>図鑑評価：全国図鑑
・捕まえた数が
　40～79匹</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士：父</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
